[{"title":"赠黄真护道人游茅山","author":"楼钥","text":"少年曾上三茅山，千岩万壑穷跻攀。\n烟霏空翠不可状，弟兄联骑欣清閒。\n回头五十有馀载，至今梦境犹班班。\n初从崇禧入仙境，元符玉晨纷幢幡。\n草庵精舍不知数，各占山麓清溪湾。\n蓑衣相见黑虎谷，苍然白发犹朱颜。\n延之土窟款清论，桃皮酿酒无留残。\n达道所居更奇绝，万山开豁如重关。\n一山巉岩似笔格，耸秀正矗湖中间。\n白马真人尚生气，长史旧井藏馀丹。\n异石若碎还复合，豢龙几处多澄澜。\n华阳洞门闭已久，传闻亦有游其藩。\n抚掌浮沤涌如沸，仙人捧石手可扳。\n最奇无如大茅峰，千寻直上天市坛。\n中峰小峰如雁行，下视堆阜罗烟鬟。\n三君司命时归降，往往天风吹佩环。\n人言春日羽衣会，胎禽终日来飞翻。\n玄帝大鼎秦皇璧，丹砂六千在流泉。\n地无虺虎与荆棘，但有众药堪延年。\n洞天凡踪不易到，我欲再往良独难。\n有时慨想旧游处，陟冈惘惘涕为潸。\n江夏仙人有仙骨，卓尔拔俗甘瓢箪。\n摇铃真能彻帝所，挥钁自足驱神奸。\n曾入金华访初平，今往地肺求洞玄。\n游经都城道价重，拂袖忽厌拘尘烦。\n径登紫芝绣衣亭，咫尺众真相往还。\n神仙渺茫信可学，祇恐涓尘天意悭。\n但见茅君极仙品，谁知求道越岨艰。\n至今丰碑载锡文，舟堕千剑如指弹。\n君得此居宜勇进，勿使学步讥邯郸。\n我欲休官未容去，归梦遇觉多愁叹。\n终当挂冠四明隐，扪萝采石纫芝兰。\n江东日暮云生处，安得羽化同霞餐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25821,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠熊道人","author":"楼钥","text":"十载隐潭衡，居然腑肺清。\n枯禅参懒瓒，老气激弥明。\n笔底烟云妙，人间势利轻。\n款门俄告别，江海一浮萍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25822,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孺人曾氏挽词","author":"楼钥","text":"婉嫕应眉寿，天胡弗与龄。\n情深孙楚咏，泪尽女挐铭。\n蘋藻空南涧，芝兰有谢庭。\n越山埋璧处，秋雨湿铭旌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25823,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋涂毒与惠老偈","author":"楼钥","text":"我铭师塔，而不识面。\n一瞻顶相，烂烂岩电。\n横说竖说，不待饶舌。\n涂毒一声，百兽脑裂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25824,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六言问天池宝华","author":"楼钥","text":"昔年曾赋虎丘，犹恨灵岩未游。\n天池之景绝胜，宝华有水倒流。\n老矣不复西去，梦入陶朱扁舟。\n烦君为我寻访，能以新诗寄不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25825,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游雪窦双塔登云檐有怀海印云老","author":"楼钥","text":"来礼二师遗像，小立云檐一饷。\n欲见德云比丘，却在别峰顶上。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25826,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋袁起岩所藏脩禊序 其一","author":"楼钥","text":"怅望当时真迹，临摹所在支分。\n千载但称合作，谁能有感斯文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25827,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋袁起岩所藏脩禊序 其二","author":"楼钥","text":"定本为世第一，此又在定武前。\n今日锦标玉轴，向来不直一钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25828,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋惠峰询老所编类海","author":"楼钥","text":"古德手段决裂，剥地破■地折。\n说道不立文字，未免横说竖说。\n草庵文字太多，只为老婆心切。\n若不作恁么看，将谓多口饶舌。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25829,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题老融画牛溪烟雨","author":"楼钥","text":"暝烟吹雨冥冥，两牛半渡深清。\n京尘久污巾履，颇思归濯吾缨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25830,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题老融画弥勒","author":"楼钥","text":"乘风欲去东南，回头此意谁参。\n当时蹉过足庵，却来攻愧同龛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25831,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题杨子元琪所藏东坡古木","author":"楼钥","text":"东坡笔端游戏，槎牙老气横秋。\n笑揖退廉博士，信酷似文湖州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25832,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孝宗皇帝神主自重华宫 至太庙祔庙鼓吹导引曲","author":"楼钥","text":"吾皇尽孝，宗庙务崇尊。\n钜典备弥文。\n巍巍东向开基主，七世祔神孙。\n追思九闰整乾坤。\n环宇慕洪恩。\n从今密迩高宗室，千载事如存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25833,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孝宗皇帝虞主自浙江 还重华宫鼓吹导引曲","author":"楼钥","text":"孝宗纯孝，前圣更何加。\n高蹈处重华。\n丹成仙去龙輴远，越岸暮山遐。\n波臣先为卷寒沙。\n来往护灵槎。\n九虞礼举神祗乐，万世佑皇家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25834,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和东坡醉翁操韵咏风琴","author":"楼钥","text":"泠然，轻圆。\n谁弹，向屋山。\n何言，清风至阴德之天。\n悠飏馀响婵娟，方昼眠。\n迥立八风前，八音相宣知孰贤。\n有时悲壮，铿若龙泉。\n有时幽杳，彷佛猿吟鹤怨。\n忽若巍巍山颠，荡荡几如流川。\n聊将娱暮年，听之身欲仙。\n弦索满人间，未有逸韵如此弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25835,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"楼钥","text":"门前莫约频来客，坐上同观未见书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25836,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐居凤山清明寺 其二","author":"楼淳","text":"日上钟未鸣，老僧睡犹熟。\n谁是山中人，长享清明福。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25837,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐居凤山清明寺 其一","author":"楼淳","text":"凤鸟久不至，哲人叹已矣。\n空留千载名，寂寞残阳里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25838,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明寺","author":"楼淳","text":"风尘满天下，此地独清明。\n神州何处是，有泪落新亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25839,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十七","author":"楼楚材","text":"鹭等鱼船近了飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25840,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜天晓角 其一 梅","author":"楼槃","text":"月淡风轻。\n黄昏未是清。\n吟到十分清处，也不啻、二三更。\n晓钟天未明。\n晓霜人未行。\n只有城头残角，说得尽、我平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25841,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜天晓角 其二","author":"楼槃","text":"剪雪裁冰。\n有人嫌太清。\n又有人嫌太瘦，都不是、我知音。\n谁是我知音。\n孤山人姓林。\n一自西湖别后，辜负我、到如今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25842,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 双桧堂","author":"楼锷","text":"夏半阳乌景最长。\n小池不断藕花香。\n电影雷声催急雨，十分凉。\n芡剥明珠随意嚼，瓜分琼玉趁时尝。\n双桧堂深新酿好，且传觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25843,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵泉寺","author":"楼燧","text":"孺兴往事亦难明，对景思人想独清。\n黄绢异时留好语，幽泉千古擅佳名。\n五星巧作联珠势，一派尝闻泻玉声。\n他日相逢如话旧，也曾到此会簪缨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25844,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其四 一眠","author":"楼璹","text":"蚕眠白日静，鸟语青春长。\n抱胫聊假寐，孰能事梳妆。\n水边多丽人，罗衣蹋春阳。\n春阳无限思，岂知问农桑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25845,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其五 二眠","author":"楼璹","text":"吴蚕一再眠，竹屋下帘幕。\n拍手弄婴儿，一笑姑不恶。\n风来麦秀寒，雨过桑沃若。\n日高蚕未起，谷鸟鸣百箔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25846,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其六 三眠","author":"楼璹","text":"屋里蚕三眠，门前春过半。\n桑麻绿阴合，风雨长檠暗。\n叶底虫丝繁，卧作字画短。\n偷閒一枕肱，梦与杨花乱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25847,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十一 上簇","author":"楼璹","text":"采采绿叶空，剪剪白茅短。\n撒簇轻放手，蚕老丝肠嫩。\n山市浮晴岚，风日作妍暖。\n会看茧如瓮，累累光眩眼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25848,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其二 下蚕","author":"楼璹","text":"谷雨无几日，溪山暖风高。\n华蚕初破壳，落纸细于毛。\n柔桑摘蝉翼，簌簌才容刀。\n茅檐纸窗明，未觉眼力劳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25849,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十三 下簇","author":"楼璹","text":"晴明开雪屋，门巷排银山。\n一年蚕事办，下簇春向阑。\n邻里两相贺，翁媪一笑欢。\n后妃应献茧，喜色开天颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25850,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其九 大起","author":"楼璹","text":"盈箱大起时，食桑声似雨。\n春风老不知，蚕妇忙如许。\n呼儿刈青麦，朝饭已过午。\n妖歌得绫罗，不易青裙女。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25851,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其七 分箔","author":"楼璹","text":"三眠三起馀，饱叶蚕局促。\n众多旋分箔，早晚磓满屋。\n郊原过新雨，桑柘添浓绿。\n竹閒快活吟，惭愧麦饱熟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25852,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其二十一 纬","author":"楼璹","text":"浸纬供织作，寒女两髻丫。\n缱绻一缕丝，成就百种花。\n弄水春笋寒，卷轮蟾影斜。\n人閒小阿香，晴空转雷车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25853,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十四 择茧","author":"楼璹","text":"大茧至八蚕，小茧止独蛹。\n茧衣绕指柔，收拾拟何用。\n冬来作缥絖，与儿禦寒冻。\n衣帛非不能，债多租税重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25854,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十二 炙箔","author":"楼璹","text":"峨峨爇薪炭，重重下帘幕。\n初出虫结网，遽若雪满箔。\n老翁不胜勤，候火珠汗落。\n得閒儿女子，困卧呼不觉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25855,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其二十二 织","author":"楼璹","text":"青镫映帏幕，络纬鸣井栏。\n轧轧挥素手，风露凄已寒。\n辛勤度几梭，始复成一端。\n寄言罗绮伴，当念麻苧单。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25856,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其二十 经","author":"楼璹","text":"素丝头绪多，羡君好安排。\n青鞋不动尘，缓步交去来。\n脉脉意欲乱，眷眷首重回。\n王言正如丝，亦付经纶才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25857,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其八 采桑","author":"楼璹","text":"吴儿歌采桑，桑下青春深。\n邻里讲欢好，逊畔无欺侵。\n筠篮各自携，筠梯高倍寻。\n黄鹂饱紫葚，哑咤鸣绿阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25858,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十八 祝谢","author":"楼璹","text":"春前作蚕市，盛事传西蜀。\n此邦享先蚕，再拜丝满目。\n马革裹玉肌，能神不为辱。\n虽云事渺茫，解与民为福。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25859,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十九 络丝","author":"楼璹","text":"儿夫督机丝，输官趁时节。\n向来催租瘢，正为坐踰越。\n朝来掉篗勤，宁复辞腕脱。\n辛勤夜未眠，败屋灯明灭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25860,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十 捉绩","author":"楼璹","text":"麦黄雨初足，蚕老人愈忙。\n辛勤减眠食，颠倒著衣裳。\n丝肠映绿叶，练练金色光。\n松明照夜屋，杜宇啼东冈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25861,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其一 浴蚕","author":"楼璹","text":"农桑将有事，时节过禁烟。\n轻风归燕日，小雨浴蚕天。\n春衫卷缟袂，盆池弄清泉。\n深宫想斋戒，躬桑率民先。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25862,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十七 蚕蛾","author":"楼璹","text":"蛾初脱缠缚，如蝶栩栩然。\n得偶粉翅光，散子金粟圜。\n岁月判悠悠，种嗣期绵绵。\n送蛾临远水，早归属明年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25863,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其二十四 剪帛","author":"楼璹","text":"低眉事机杼，细意把刀尺。\n盈盈彼美人，剪剪其束帛。\n输官给边用，辛苦何足惜。\n大胜汉缭绫，粉涴不再著。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25864,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其三 喂蚕","author":"楼璹","text":"蚕儿初饭时，桑叶如钱许。\n扳条摘鹅黄，藉纸观蚁聚。\n屋头草木长，窗下儿女语。\n日长人颇閒，针线随缉补。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25865,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十五 窖茧","author":"楼璹","text":"盘中水晶咸，井上梧桐叶。\n陶器固封泥，窖茧过旬浃。\n门前春水生，布谷催畚锸。\n明朝蹋缫车，车轮缠白氎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25866,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其十六 缫丝","author":"楼璹","text":"连村煮茧香，解事谁家娘。\n盈盈意媚灶，拍拍手探汤。\n上盆颜色好，转轴头绪长。\n晚来得少休，女伴语隔墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25867,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织图二十四首 其二十三 攀花","author":"楼璹","text":"时态尚新巧，女工慕精勤。\n心手暗相应，照眼花纷纭。\n殷勤挑锦字，曲折读回文。\n更将无限思，织作雁背云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25868,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其十 一耘","author":"楼璹","text":"时雨既已降，良苗日怀新。\n去草如去恶，务令尽陈根。\n泥蟠任犊鼻，膝行生浪纹。\n眷惟圣天子，傥亦思鸟耘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25869,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其十一 二耘","author":"楼璹","text":"解衣日炙背，戴笠汗濡首。\n敢辞冒炎蒸，但欲去莨莠。\n壶浆与箪食，亭午来饷妇。\n要儿知稼穑，岂曰事携幼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25870,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其二十一 入仓","author":"楼璹","text":"天寒牛在牢，岁暮粟入庾。\n田父有馀乐，炙背卧檐庑。\n却愁催赋租，胥吏来旁午。\n输官王事了，索饭儿叫怒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25871,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其十二 三耘","author":"楼璹","text":"农田亦甚劬，三复事耘耔。\n经年苦艰食，喜见苗薿薿。\n老农念一饱，对此出馋水。\n愿天均雨旸，满野如云委。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25872,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其六 布秧","author":"楼璹","text":"旧谷发新颖，梅黄雨生肥。\n下田初播殖，却行手奋挥。\n明朝望平畴，绿针刺风漪。\n审此一寸根，行作合穗期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25873,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其十四 收刈","author":"楼璹","text":"田家刈穫时，腰镰竞仓卒。\n霜浓手龟坼，日永身罄折。\n儿童行拾穗，风色凌短褐。\n欢呼荷担归，望望屋山月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25874,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其八 拔秧","author":"楼璹","text":"新秧初出水，渺渺翠毯齐。\n清晨且拔擢，父子争提携。\n既沐青满握，再栉根无泥。\n及时趁芒种，散著畦东西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25875,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其三 杷耨","author":"楼璹","text":"雨笠冒宿雾，风蓑拥春寒。\n破块得甘霔，齧塍浸微澜。\n泥深四蹄重，日暮两股酸。\n谓彼牛后人，著鞭无作难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25876,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其十六 持穗","author":"楼璹","text":"霜时天气佳，风劲木叶脱。\n持穗及此时，连枷声乱发。\n黄鸡啄遗粒，乌鸟喜聒聒。\n归家抖尘埃，夜屋烧榾柮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25877,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其一 浸种","author":"楼璹","text":"溪头夜雨足，门外春水生。\n筠篮浸浅碧，嘉谷抽新萌。\n西畴将有事，耒耜随晨兴。\n只鸡祭句芒，再拜祈秋成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25878,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其十八 砻","author":"楼璹","text":"推挽人摩肩，展转石砺齿。\n殷床作春雷，旋风落云子。\n有如布山川，部娄势相峙。\n前时斗量珠，满眼俄有此。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25879,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其二 耕","author":"楼璹","text":"东皋一犁雨，布谷初催耕。\n绿野暗春晓，乌犍苦肩赪。\n我衔劝农字，杖策东郊行。\n永怀历山下，法事关圣情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25880,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其四 耖","author":"楼璹","text":"脱绔下田中，盎浆著塍尾。\n巡行遍畦畛，扶耖均泥滓。\n迟迟春日斜，稍稍樵歌起。\n薄暮佩牛归，共浴前溪水。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25881,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其七 淤荫","author":"楼璹","text":"杀草闻吴儿，洒灰传自祖。\n田田皆沃壤，泫泫流膏乳。\n塍头乌啄泥，谷口鸠唤雨。\n敢望稼如云，工夫盖如许。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25882,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其十九 舂碓","author":"楼璹","text":"娟娟月过墙，簌簌风吹叶。\n田家当此时，村舂响相答。\n行闻炊玉香，会见流匙滑。\n更须水转轮，地碓劳蹴蹋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25883,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其九 插秧","author":"楼璹","text":"晨雨麦秋润，午风槐夏凉。\n溪南与溪北，啸歌插新秧。\n抛掷不停手，左右无乱行。\n我将教秧马，代劳民莫忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25884,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其十五 登场","author":"楼璹","text":"禾黍已登场，稍觉农事优。\n黄云满高架，白水空西畴。\n用此可卒岁，愿言免防秋。\n太平本无象，村舍炊烟浮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25885,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其二十 筛","author":"楼璹","text":"茅檐閒杵臼，竹屋细筛簸。\n照人珠琲光，奋臂风雨过。\n计功初不浅，饱食良自贺。\n西邻华屋儿，醉饱正高卧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25886,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耕图二十一首 其五 碌碡","author":"楼璹","text":"力田巧机事，利器由心匠。\n翩翩转圜枢，衮衮鸣翠浪。\n三春欲尽头，万顷平如掌。\n渐暄牛已喘，长怀丙丞相。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25887,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]